# Screenshot capture for the project cards.
#
# KEEP THIS SET IN THE VERCEL PROJECT'S ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES. It is read at
# BUILD time by vite.config.ts, which recaptures every live project into dist/
# so each deploy ships current screenshots. Unset, the build silently skips
# capture and serves the images committed in public/images/ instead — so a
# missing key degrades to slightly stale images, never to a failed build.
#
# It is no longer read at runtime. A Vercel Edge Function (api/screenshot.ts)
# used to hold this key and proxy captures on request, but nothing in the app
# ever called it: it was an unauthenticated public endpoint spending a metered
# quota for a feature that had already moved to static assets. Removed.
#
# Copy to .env for local use and fill in your own key — never commit the real value.
# Refresh the committed fallbacks with: npm run update-screenshots
SCREENSHOT_API_KEY=your_key_here


# ── AI mode (api/ask.ts) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Read at RUNTIME by the edge function only. These must NEVER be prefixed
# VITE_ — that prefix inlines the value into the client bundle and hands every
# visitor a key they can spend. The whole reason api/ask.ts exists is to keep
# these server-side.
#
# Set them in the Vercel project's Environment Variables dashboard.
#
# Both are OPTIONAL. With neither set, the `ai` command still works: the
# endpoint reports itself unconfigured and the terminal answers with a keyword
# match over the site's own data. A supported mode, not a broken one.
#
# Gemini is tried first, Groq second, so a rate-limited or briefly failing
# primary degrades answer quality rather than removing the feature.
#   Gemini key: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#   Groq key:   https://console.groq.com/keys   (~14,400 req/day free, no card)
GEMINI_API_KEY=
GROQ_API_KEY=

# Optional model overrides. Leave blank unless you mean it — pointing one at
# another provider's model id 404s every call while the key looks valid.
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash
# GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
